00:22:54.160 --> 00:22:59.120
massively, massively outweighs the very,

00:22:56.760 --> 00:23:01.680
very few bad days. I can count on one

00:22:59.120 --> 00:23:04.560
hand every year how many bad days we

00:23:01.680 --> 00:23:06.720
have and those days seem to get less and

00:23:04.560 --> 00:23:08.400
less as we go. And we both know that we

00:23:06.720 --> 00:23:10.720
have it in our power to give each other

00:23:08.400 --> 00:23:12.320
more enjoyment and more things to look

00:23:10.720 --> 00:23:14.600
forward to. Because if it's not a

00:23:12.320 --> 00:23:16.600
constant delight, that's a problem. And

00:23:14.600 --> 00:23:19.400
you have to be honest about that. It

00:23:16.600 --> 00:23:21.040
could also be a you problem and may not

